    "title": "GhostTube SLS Camera",
    "description": "GhostTube SLS Camera detects humanoid bodies in your environment similar to the Kinect SLS cameras used by real paranormal investigators. Read more about how it works at GhostTube.com\r\n\r\nGhostTube SLS Camera uses your phone's camera to identify human figures and homogeneous objects in your videos. Don't pay hundreds or thousands of dollars for a modified gaming console - GhostTube SLS Camera is available FREE for download and can be used as an alternative to the traditional SLS Camera in all of your paranormal investigations.\r\n\r\nFeatures included with the GhostTube paranormal app:\r\n- Detection of people shaped and homogeneous objects\r\n- Full video recording capabilities\r\n- Low light video filters to aid video filming in dark places\r\n- GhostTube paranormal community and haunted locations database with information on thousands of haunted locations\r\n*Some features may require in-app purchases.\r\n\r\nFor more paranormal investigation and ghost hunting tools, check out our other apps.\r\n\r\nGhostTube SLS Camera offers auto renewable subscriptions. Refer to our website for a full list of terms and conditions, including those relating to auto-renewable subscriptions: GhostTube.com/terms\r\n\r\nAlthough GhostTube SLS Camera offers some low light filters, the app is not intended as an aid for seeing in the dark. Always use adequate lighting on your paranormal investigations. Certain shapes and patterns may trigger figures to be mapped by GhostTube SLS Camera. Read more about how the app works at GhostTube.com",
